        "accordion_atRNKX": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Ingredients",
            "use_variant_metafield": false,
            "variant_metafield": "",
            "richtext": "<p><strong>Jumbo SPF50 Sun Stick</strong></p><p><strong>Active Ingredient:<br/></strong>Zinc Oxide (non-nano): Zinc Oxide 25%</p><p><strong>Inactive ingredients:<br/></strong>Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Wax, Isoamyl Laurate, Ethylhexyl Olivate, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, C13-15 Alkane, Polyhydroxystearic Acid, Oryza Sativa (Rice Bran) Oil, Quaternium-90 Bentonite, Capryloyl Glycerin/Sebacic Acid Copolymer, Prototheca Moriformis (Microalgae) Oil, Theobroma Cacao (Cocoa) Seed Butter, Isostearic Acid, Lecithin, Polyglyceryl-3 Polyricinoleate, Triethyl Citrate, Squalane, Physalis Angulata (Ground Cherry) Extract, Rhododendron Ferrugineum (Alpenrose) Extract, Undaria Pinnatifida (Wakame) Extract, Saccharomyces Ferment, Laurel Lysine, Tocopherol Acetate, Tocopherol</p><p><strong>Solar Shield SPF30 Spray:</strong></p><p><strong>Active Ingredient:<br/></strong>Zinc Oxide 16.5%</p><p><strong>Inactive ingredients:</strong><br/>Aloe Barbendensis Leaf Juice, Aqua/ Water, Bambusa Arundinacea (Bamboo) Stem Extract, Camellia Sinensis (Japanese Green Tea) Leaf Extract, Caprylic / Capric Triglyceride, Dilauryl Citrate, Ethylhexylglycerin, Gluconolactone, Glycerin, Hydrogenated Methyl Abietate, Isopropyl Palmitate, Lauryl Glucoside, Leuconostoc / Radish Root Ferment Filtrate, Lonicera Caprifolium (Honeysuckle) Flower Extract, Lonicera Japonica (Honeysuckle) Flower Extract, Methylcellulose, Octyldodecyl Citrate Crosspolymer, Phenoxyethanol, Polyglyceryl-4 Laurate, Populus Tremuloides Bark Extract, Simmondsia Chinensis (Jojoba) Seed Oil, Sodium Lauryl Glucose Carboxylate, Sodium Phytate, Sodium Stearoyl Glutamate, Sorbitan Laurate, Tocopherol, Xanthan Gum.</p><p></p><p>See for more information on our <a href=\"https://axoq3lapqlqkszq7-86080356657.shopifypreview.com/pages/ingredients\" title=\"Ingredients\">ingredients page</a>.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_qq9mDz": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How to use",
            "use_variant_metafield": false,
            "variant_metafield": "",
            "richtext": "<p><strong>Solar Shield SPF30 Spray</strong></p><p>Shake well before use. Hold container 4–6 inches from skin and spray liberally and evenly across the body. Apply 15 minutes before sun exposure. Reapply after 40 minutes of swimming or sweating, immediately after towel drying, and at least every 2 hours.</p><p><strong>Jumbo SPF50 Sun Stick</strong></p><p>15 minutes before going in the sun liberally apply onto face, neck, chest and body if applicable.Reapply after 80 min of swimming or sweating, immediately after towel drying and at least every 2 hours when exposed to the sun. Product can be re-applied over or under makeup.</p>"
          }
        },
